SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                50
NumberOfInitializationCycles  10
PrintEvery                    10

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeHenryCoefficients      yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.877
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e5

Component 0 MoleculeName       pentane
            MoleculeDefinition     local
            WidomProbability       1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 0.0197439

Component 1 MoleculeName       methane
            MoleculeDefinition     local
            WidomProbability       1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 1.0002

